{%- comment -%}
  NF-CART-V2 gold progress line, used by the cart drawer and the cart page.
  Tied to the REAL automatic discounts "Buy 2+ items, save 10%" (DiscountAutomaticNode/1616713646132) and, since 2026-09-25,
  "Buy 3+ items, save 15%" (DiscountAutomaticNode/1622110830644): same collection, no end date, Shopify gives the better one. If that discount ever changes or
  ends, change or remove this snippet the same day, or the copy stops being true.
  "applied" is only claimed when Shopify has actually applied a discount to the cart (cart.total_discount > 0).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%} 2026-09-24: the discount is now a PRODUCT discount on collection multi-item-discount-eligible (every product
  except product type Room Set). Room sets already carry their 10% in the price, so they do not count toward the 2 and
  never get a second 10%. nf_elig counts only the pieces the discount can apply to. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign nf_elig = 0 -%}{%- assign nf_sets = 0 -%}
{%- for li in cart.items -%}{%- if li.product.type == 'Room Set' -%}{%- assign nf_sets = nf_sets | plus: li.quantity -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign nf_elig = nf_elig | plus: li.quantity -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
{%- if cart.item_count > 0 -%}
  {%- if nf_elig >= 3 -%}
    <div class="nf-cv2-progress is-done" data-nf-cv2-count="{{ nf_elig }}">
      <p class="nf-cv2-progress__text" role="status">
        {%- if cart.total_discount > 0 -%}
          <strong>15% off applied</strong><span class="nf-cv2-progress__save">You save {{ cart.total_discount | money }}</span>
        {%- else -%}
          <strong>15% off unlocked</strong><span class="nf-cv2-progress__save">Applied at checkout</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </p>
      <div class="nf-cv2-progress__track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="nf-cv2-progress__fill"></span></div>
    </div>
  {%- elsif nf_elig == 2 -%}
    <div class="nf-cv2-progress is-done" data-nf-cv2-count="{{ nf_elig }}">
      <p class="nf-cv2-progress__text" role="status">
        {%- if cart.total_discount > 0 -%}
          <strong>10% off applied</strong><span class="nf-cv2-progress__save">1 more item makes it 15%</span>
        {%- else -%}
          <strong>10% off unlocked</strong><span class="nf-cv2-progress__save">1 more item makes it 15%</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </p>
      <div class="nf-cv2-progress__track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="nf-cv2-progress__fill"></span></div>
    </div>
  {%- elsif nf_elig == 0 -%}
    <div class="nf-cv2-progress is-done" data-nf-cv2-count="2">
      <p class="nf-cv2-progress__text" role="status"><strong>Room set saving included</strong><span class="nf-cv2-progress__save">Already 10% under the pieces bought separately</span></p>
      <div class="nf-cv2-progress__track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="nf-cv2-progress__fill"></span></div>
    </div>
  {%- else -%}
    <div class="nf-cv2-progress" data-nf-cv2-count="{{ nf_elig }}">
      <p class="nf-cv2-progress__text" role="status"><strong>1 more item</strong> unlocks 10% off, 2 more unlock 15%</p>
      <div class="nf-cv2-progress__track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="nf-cv2-progress__fill"></span></div>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
